{"id": "EUVD-2026-76357", "enisaUuid": "cb3531ac-d1b0-37bc-bc0a-32369da7c9c9", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\niommu/sva: Set handle->dev before the SVA handle is visible\n\niommu_attach_device_pasid() installs the new SVA attach handle in the\ngroup PASID lookup before iommu_sva_bind_device() returns. A concurrent\nbind can therefore find and reuse the same handle after iommu_sva_lock is\ndropped.\n\nhandle->dev was initialized after dropping iommu_sva_lock. This leaves a\nwindow where a racing bind can return a handle whose dev pointer is still\nNULL. A subsequent iommu_sva_unbind_device() can then dereference it via\nhandle->dev->iommu_group.\n\nInitialize handle->dev before releasing iommu_sva_lock so any visible SVA\nhandle is fully initialized.", "datePublished": "2026-09-11T19:43:16", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T12:47:29", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c4c71368bc5c5b3840590d39b4cfa12d733cadf4", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/bcffb1c75da8fc9d51168ff9f09d471c26507912", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/968e9a1f71140c86dc4092f6b361e997923f3813", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/37a96a30617a4c96f048a5874c00509bc4fe4d85", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/530f8f9c3546cb3ebee1b135375aaee08a073ebb"], "aliases": ["GHSA-mm8r-pp22-xwxg", "CVE-2026-89451"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.21, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "18b525bc-1b1d-3d3a-8de0-44425448397e", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.50"}, {"id": "1f7a2635-9ddf-309b-a9fc-4435c96595f5", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "be51b1d6bbff48c7d1943a8ff1e5a55777807f6e <530f8f9c3546cb3ebee1b135375aaee08a073ebb"}, {"id": "515f13a9-14db-37af-9ddb-cbcac64a8026", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "be51b1d6bbff48c7d1943a8ff1e5a55777807f6e <968e9a1f71140c86dc4092f6b361e997923f3813"}, {"id": "5640d825-a16e-3bb3-9335-756e20015e5b", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.2"}, {"id": "8d28b4e0-250d-34e6-a3d7-81119032ff49", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.6.160"}, {"id": "a022f28b-1956-3da9-b7c0-e255e6b4402f", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.12.109"}, {"id": "c05a1f4c-27b3-39f2-ad9d-1f6cafaf51be", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "be51b1d6bbff48c7d1943a8ff1e5a55777807f6e <c4c71368bc5c5b3840590d39b4cfa12d733cadf4"}, {"id": "d3106678-19a4-3cd1-946d-78e0f6dc2b07", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.4"}, {"id": "d496a52f-c2e9-329f-ae4b-828c13eb89c3", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "be51b1d6bbff48c7d1943a8ff1e5a55777807f6e <37a96a30617a4c96f048a5874c00509bc4fe4d85"}, {"id": "daac2bec-67e8-3f07-a5fc-ad47be948979", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "e82ee3e1-cdb1-374e-9ef0-480bd515eb0e", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "be51b1d6bbff48c7d1943a8ff1e5a55777807f6e <bcffb1c75da8fc9d51168ff9f09d471c26507912"}, {"id": "ec4707b0-b628-351f-ae90-2e045e8a762a", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "6001a8c6-7a86-36ba-9ca4-4fa11262026b", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}